---
description: Flutter widget rebuild and list performance
globs: flutter_app/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Avoid unnecessary Flutter widget rebuilds.
Use const constructors whenever applicable.
Keep expensive computations outside build().
Do not perform asynchronous work directly inside build().
Avoid rebuilding large widget trees when only a small section needs to update.

For lists, use efficient builders and stable keys when appropriate.
Do not optimize based on assumptions.
When performance is a concern, use Flutter DevTools/profile data to identify
the actual bottleneck before making significant optimization changes.
